# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository, and check it out as LF
# everywhere.  This matters for more than tidiness: the ported build scripts
# (`ports/**/*.sh`) must run under Git Bash and under Linux CI alike, and the
# engine patch (`ports/artemis/engine/0001-web-host.patch`) has to stay
# byte-comparable with `git diff` output so that `git apply` accepts it.  A
# CRLF checkout would break both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts: never touch their bytes, never try to diff them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
